# Cross-origin isolation for multi-threaded WASM (onnxruntime-web needs
# SharedArrayBuffer). `credentialless` (not require-corp) keeps SharedArrayBuffer
# on Chromium/Firefox while letting Apple MapKit tiles (no CORP headers) load.
# Parsed by Cloudflare Workers static assets (not served as a file).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
